Name: HERMES_2013_I1111237
Year: 2013
Summary: Exact-bin unpolarized identified-hadron cos(phi) and cos(2phi) diagnostics
Experiment: HERMES
Collider: DESY HERA fixed target
InspireID: 1111237
Status: UNVALIDATED
Reentrant: true
Authors:
