RunInfo: >
  Requires zero-polarization 27.6 GeV e+ p and e+ n samples, with POSNLO and
  NEGNLO generated separately. Numerical HERMES values and covariance matrices
  are not vendored because the collaboration endpoint is currently unavailable.
NumEvents: 100000
NeedsCrossSection: yes
Beams: [[POSITRON, PROTON], [POSITRON, NEUTRON]]
Energies: [[27.6, 0.938272], [27.6, 0.939565]]
Description: >
  Fills direct <cos(phi)> and <cos(2phi)> moments for unidentified charged
  hadrons, pions and kaons in every one of the published 900 (x,y,z,pT) cells.
  Hydrogen and deuterium predictions are formed by the runner. This is a
  data-free generator diagnostic until the official 21,600 moment values
  (900 cells for 12 target/species/charge groups and two moments) and their
  covariance matrices can be checksum-pinned.
Keywords: [DIS, SIDIS, fixed-target, azimuthal moment, pion, kaon]
